# Intel "pro" GPU stack — appended ONLY for --gpu-driver intel-pro. Intel has NO
# proprietary Xorg driver: the OPEN i915/iris driver (VIDEO_CARDS=intel iris) IS
# the display driver. These add the full Intel compute + media userspace: the
# OpenCL/Level-Zero compute runtime, the iHD VAAPI media driver, and the oneVPL
# GPU runtime. (All MIT/redistributable — no EULA.)
dev-libs/intel-compute-runtime
media-libs/libva-intel-media-driver
media-libs/vpl-gpu-rt
